---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms · AutoDeck" description="The terms for using AutoDeck services, bookings and memberships." page="terms">
  <section class="phero"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p class="lede">Last updated 14 October 2026. These terms cover use of the AutoDeck website and app, bookings and memberships.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="s" style="padding-top:40px"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;display:grid;gap:22px">
    <div><h3>Bookings</h3><p>A booking reserves a time at the studio. If your car does not arrive by studio closing time on the day, the booking is cancelled automatically. Time estimates are estimates. Some work takes longer once the car is inspected, and we ask for your approval before any extra work or cost.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Prices and payment</h3><p>Prices in the app include GST and depend on your car's size. You can pay at the studio or online where offered. Online payments are processed by Razorpay.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Memberships</h3><p>A membership starts when payment is confirmed. A membership request that is not paid within 48 hours is cancelled automatically. Washes and discounts are available only while the membership is active.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Your car</h3><p>We take care of your car while it is with us. Please remove valuables. Existing damage is recorded at check-in so we can both see the starting condition.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Your account</h3><p>Keep your sign-in secure. You are responsible for the bookings made from your account.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Questions</h3><p>Call or message us on <a class="link" href="tel:+919898679711">+91 98986 79711</a>.</p></div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
